Package: ausPH
Title: Retrieve Data from the Parliamentary Handbook of the Commonwealth of Australia
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Pat", "Leslie", , "patrick.leslie@anu.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9218-8981"))
Description: Retrieves data from the Australian Parliamentary Library's
    Parliamentary Handbook <https://handbook.aph.gov.au/> and returns it as
    tidy tables: members and senators, their parliamentary and party service,
    ministries, shadow ministries, committees, parties, electorates,
    parliaments, sitting dates, elections and two candidate preferred results.
    Known errors in the Handbook are flagged, and can optionally be corrected
    from a documented errata table.
